WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.988
Check five.

2
00:00:00.988 --> 00:00:04.231
SailPoint reports success
for the fix to Erin's record,

3
00:00:04.231 --> 00:00:06.826
and the closure signal reaches ServiceNow.

4
00:00:06.826 --> 00:00:08.412
